(2755,0,0,'What?  $n, you served me well, but...',12,0,0,0,0,0,'Myzrael'),
(2755,1,0,'Why have you summoned me so soon?  I haven\'t yet reached my full power!',12,0,0,0,0,0,'Myzrael'),
(2755,2,0,'No matter.  You were a fool to help me, and now you will pay!',12,0,0,0,0,0,'Myzrael'),
(3395,0,0,'I am summoned!  Intruders, come to my tent and face your death!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Verog the Dervish'),
(3451,0,0,'Looks like you\'ll have to go ahead to Ratchet and tell Sputtervalve that I\'ve wrecked the shredder.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Pilot Wizzlecrank'),
(3451,1,0,'I\'ll stay behind and guard the wreck. Hurry! Hopefully no one will notice the smoke...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Pilot Wizzlecrank'),
(3644,0,0,'Anaya...? Do my eyes deceive me? Is it really you?',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),
(3644,1,0,'That the fates should be so cruel as to permit us only this after a thousand years apart...',16,7,100,1,0,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),
(3644,2,0,'Do you hate me, my love? That I was forced to destroy your living form, that your spirit be released from unhappy bondage.',16,7,100,1,0,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),
(3644,3,0,'No! Anaya... Anaya! Don\'t leave me! Please...',12,7,100,5,0,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),
(3644,4,0,'How, my love? How will I find the strength to face the ages of the world without you by my side...',12,7,100,5,0,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),
(3667,0,0,'Finally, my soul may rest... Oh, dearest Cerellean...',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Anaya Dawnrunner'),
(3899,0,0,'Not quite so sure of yourself without the Purifier, hm?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Balizar the Umbrage'),
(4484,0,0,'It looks like we\'re in trouble. Look lively, here they come!',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Feero'),
(4484,1,0,'Assassins from that cult you found... Let\'s get moving before someone else finds us out here.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Feero'),
(4484,2,0,'Hold! I sense an evil presence... Undead!',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Feero'),
(4484,3,0,'They\'re coming out of the woodwork today. Let\'s keep moving or we may find more things that want me dead.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Feero'),
(4484,4,0,'These three again?',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Feero'),
(4484,5,0,'I\'ll finish you off for good this time!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Feero'),
(4484,6,0,'Well done! I should be fine on my own from here. Remember to talk to Delgren when you return to Maestra\'s Post in Ashenvale.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Feero'),
(4484,7,0,'We must move quickly. Auberdine isn\'t too far away, but many enemies lurk in the forest.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Feero'),
(4509,0,0,'In the throes of the Sundering, Ameth\'Aran was at the whim of the terror that gripped the land. There was little hope for survival.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Sargath'),
(4509,1,0,'Athrikus came to us. He told us that he could save us from harm. He cast a spell upon us to protect us from harm.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Sargath'),
(4509,2,0,'When the shaking stopped, his true motives were revealed. We were trapped, and he was slowly draining our powers.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Sargath'),
(4509,3,0,'There were hundreds imprisoned by his spell. Now only a few remain in their prisons. He would speak to us sometimes.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Sargath'),
(4509,4,0,'He worried that his power weakened, that soon even we last of his precious soulgems would fade and die.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Sargath'),
(4509,5,0,'His lieutenant, Ilkrud Magthrull possesses a tome which might indicate the location of the remaining soulgems.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Sargath'),
(5267,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Unliving Atal\'ai'),
(6523,0,0,'Never cross a Dark Iron, $C.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Rifleman'),
(6523,0,1,'Time to die, $C.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Rifleman'),
(6523,0,2,'Feel the power of the Dark Iron Dwarves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dark Iron Rifleman'),
(8421,0,0,'Fools, I knew that if I played upon my brother\'s feeble emotions, he would send \'rescuers.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dorius'),
(8421,1,0,'How easy it was to manipulate you into recovering the last Suntara stone from those imbeciles of the Twilight\'s Hammer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dorius'),
(8421,2,0,'When I stumbled upon the Suntara stones at the Grimesilt Digsite, the power of Ragnaros surged through my being. It was Ragnaros that gave me a purpose.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dorius'),
(8421,3,0,'It was the will of Ragnaros that Obsidion be built. Obsidion will destroy the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire, uniting us with our bretheren in the fiery depths.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dorius'),
(8421,4,0,'And ultimately, it was Ragnaros that named me when I was reborn as an acolyte of fire: Lathoric... Lathoric the Black.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dorius'),
(8421,5,0,'%s\'s laughter trails off...',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Dorius'),
(8421,6,0,'Bravo! Bravo! Good show. What? You thought I was dead?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Dorius'),
(8580,0,0,'So or\'manley fi siame Dim fus siame yudo',14,14,100,0,0,5859,'Atal\'alarion'),
(8580,1,0,'You will rest with the honored dead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Atal\'alarion'),
(8877,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Sandfury Zealot'),
(8957,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Angerclaw Grizzly'),
(10373,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Xabraxxis'),
(11256,0,0,'NO!!!  It puts the tannin in the basket, or it gets the mallet again!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Manifestation of Water'),
(11677,0,0,'Snivvle is here!  Snivvle claims the Coldtooth mine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Taskmaster Snivvle'),
(11680,0,0,'Never cross a Dark Iron, $C.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Horde Scout'),
(11680,0,1,'Time to die, $C.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Horde Scout'),
(11680,0,2,'Feel the power of the Dark Iron Dwarves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Horde Scout'),
(11840,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Wildpaw Alpha'),
(12046,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Gor\'marok the Ravager'),
(12579,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Bloodfury Ripper'),
(12918,0,0,'You are a little gnat to the Foulweald!  Die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Chief Murgut'),
(12918,1,0,'No!  You cannot be stronger than the Foulweald!  No!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Chief Murgut'),
(12921,0,0,'%s attacks the banner!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Enraged Foulweald'),
(13083,0,0,'All of your efforts have been in vain, for the draining of the World Tree has already begun! Soon, the heart of your world shall beat no more!',14,0,100,0,0,10986,'Echo of Archimonde'),
(14305,1,0,'This has to be the biggest diamond ever!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: The Biggest Diamond Ever'),
(14305,2,0,'It looks just like the paintings of King Magni too! Did he really do this to himself?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: The Biggest Diamond Ever'),
(14305,3,0,'Wow, I don\'t think that was such a good idea...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: The Biggest Diamond Ever'),
(14305,4,0,'I\'m really sorry you lost your king. But in a way, it\'s like he\'s with you forever!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: The Biggest Diamond Ever'),
(14305,5,0,'Wow, you sure don\'t look like any night elf I\'ve seen before!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: Malfurion has Returned'),
(14305,6,0,'Our orphan matron says druids can turn into birds, cats, and bears, but you look like a combination of all of them!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: Malfurion has Returned'),
(14305,7,0,'I see what you\'re doing. You\'re gonna take all the druid forms and make them into one super-form!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: Malfurion has Returned'),
(14305,8,0,'The Emerald Dream doesn\'t sound like a place for me. What if it turns me into a turtle? I\'ve always wanted wings, though...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: Malfurion has Returned'),
(14305,9,0,'Wheeee! I\'m a bird-boy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: Malfurion has Returned'),
(14435,0,0,'My power is discombobulatingly devastating! It is ludicrous that these mortals even attempt to enter my realm!\n',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Prince Thunderaan'),
(14444,1,0,'Wow, so you\'re the Banshee Queen? I kind of expected you to be taller!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: The Banshee Queen'),
(14444,2,0,'Everyone says you had a fight with the warchief and you\'re going to abandon the Horde. Is that true?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: The Banshee Queen'),
(14444,3,0,'So it\'s not true? Thank the ancestors! I wouldn\'t want you to be my enemy, Lady Sylvanas.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: The Banshee Queen'),
(14444,4,0,'So this is how a chieftain is honored!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Children\'s Week - Quest: The Fallen Chieftain'),
(15491,0,0,'Pitiful, predictable mortals... You know not what you have done! The Master\'s will fulfilled. The Moonglade shall be destroyed and Malfurion along with it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 0'),
(15491,1,1,'%s lets loose a sinister laugh.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 1'),
(15491,2,2,'You are certainly not your father, insect. Should it interest me, I would crush you with but a swipe of my claws. Turn Shan\'do Stormrage over to me and your pitiful life will be spared along with the lives of your people.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 2'),
(15491,3,3,'My redemption? You are bold, little one. My redemption comes by the will of my god.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 3'),
(15491,4,4,'%s roars furiously.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 4'),
(15491,5,5,'Rise, servants of the Nightmare! Rise and destroy this world! Let there be no survivors...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 5'),
(15491,6,6,'Where is your savior? How long can you hold out against my attacks? ',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 6'),
(15491,7,7,'Remulos, look how easy they fall before me? You can stop this, fool. Turn the druid over to me and it will all be over...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 7'),
(15491,8,8,'Defeated my minions? Then face me, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 8'),
(15491,9,9,'IT BURNS! THE PAIN... SEARING...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 9'),
(15491,10,10,'WHY? Why did this happen to ... to me? Where were you Tyrande? Where were you when I fell from the grace of Elune?',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 10'),
(15491,11,11,'I... I feel... I feel the touch of Elune upon my being once more... She smiles upon me... Yes... I...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 11'),
(15491,12,12,'%s falls to one knee.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus Say 12'),
(15623,0,0,'Your meddling in demonic affairs ends NOW, mortal!  Face the great corruptor - Xandivious!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Xandivious'),
(15623,1,0,'If it is my fate to fall, then my dying breath shall take you with me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Xandivious'),
(15623,2,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Xandivious'),
(15628,0,0,'For so long, I was lost... The Nightmare\'s corruption had consumed me... And now, you... all of you... you have saved me. Released me from its grasp.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus the Redeemed Say 0'),
(15628,1,1,'But... Malfurion, Cenarius, Ysera... they still fight. They need me. I must return to the Dream at once.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus the Redeemed Say 0'),
(15628,2,2,'My lady, I am unworthy of your prayer. Truly, you are an angel of light. Please, assist me in returning to the barrow den so that I may return to the Dream. I, like Malfurion, also have a love awaiting me... I must return to her... to protect her...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus the Redeemed Say 0'),
(15628,3,3,'And heroes... I hold that which you seek. May it once more see the evil dissolved. Remulos, see to it that our champion receives the shard of the Green Flight.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Eranikus the Redeemed Say 0'),
(15629,0,0,'%s drinks in the suffering of the fallen.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Nightmare Phantasm Say 0'),
(15633,0,0,'Seek absolution, Eranikus. All will be forgiven...\n',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Tyrande Say 0'),
(15633,1,1,'You will be forgiven, Eranikus. Elune will always love you. Break free of the bonds that command you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Tyrande Say 0'),
(15633,2,2,'The grasp of the Old Gods is unmoving. He is consumed by their dark thoughts... I... I cannot... cannot channel much longer... Elune aid me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Tyrande Say 0'),
(16042,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Lord Valthalak - Cast Frenzy'),
(16098,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Empyrean'),
(16534,0,0,'The %s nods appreciatively.',16,0,100,2,0,0,'Inoculated Nestlewood Owlkin'),
(16534,0,1,'The %s looks confused.',16,0,100,6,0,0,'Inoculated Nestlewood Owlkin'),
(16534,0,2,'The %s didn\'t like what just happened.',16,0,100,18,0,0,'Inoculated Nestlewood Owlkin'),
(16534,0,3,'The %s seems overjoyed.',16,0,100,4,0,0,'Inoculated Nestlewood Owlkin'),
(16534,0,4,'The %s doesn\'t look like it minds the crystal\'s effects.',16,0,100,22,0,0,'Inoculated Nestlewood Owlkin'),
(17000,0,0,'Fools!  You seek to abjure my father\'s presence?  Death awaits you, mortals!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Aggonis'),
(17623,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Reaver Guard'),
(17651,0,0,'You\'ve got my attention, dragon.  You\'ll find I\'m not as easily scared as the villagers below.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17651,1,0,'You dare challenge me at my own dwelling?  Your arrogance is astounding, even for a dragon!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17651,2,0,'I do not know what you speak of, dragon... but  I will not be bullied by this display of insolence.  I\'ll leave Karazhan when it suits me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17651,3,0,'%s begins to cast a spell of great power, weaving his own essence into the magic.',16,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17651,4,0,'He should not have angered me.  I must go... recover my strength now...',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17652,0,0,'Your dabbling in the arcane has gone too far, Medivh.  You\'ve attracted the attention of powers beyond your understanding.  You must leave Karazhan at once!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17652,1,0,'A dark power seeks to use you, Medivh!  If you stay, dire days will follow.  You must hurry, we don\'t have much time!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17652,2,0,'You leave me no alternative.  I will stop you by force if you won\'t listen to reason!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17652,3,0,'What have you done, wizard?  This cannot be!  I\'m burning from... within!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(17681,0,0,'Woot! Thanks!',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Expedition Researcher'),
(17835,0,0,'The wizard will fall!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Infinite Assassin'),
(17835,0,1,'We will not be stopped!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Infinite Assassin'),
(17835,0,2,'Your efforts... are in vain.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Infinite Assassin'),
(17839,0,0,'Victory or Death!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rift Lord'),
(17839,0,1,'You are running out of time!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rift Lord'),
(17839,0,2,'The rift must be protected!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rift Lord'),
(17853,0,0,'We\'ve got you now, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Tracker of the Hand'),
(17853,1,0,'Return to Kuros. I will bring him to Blood Watch.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Tracker of the Hand'),
(17892,0,0,'We are not finished!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Infinite Chronomancer'),
(17892,0,1,'Death to the Last Guardian!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Infinite Chronomancer'),
(17892,0,2,'We will not fail!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Infinite Chronomancer'),
(17949,0,0,'Remulos, old friend. It is good to see you once more. I knew that the message would find its way to you - one way or another.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage - say Text 0'),
(17949,1,0,'I fear for the worst, old friend. Within the Dream we fight a new foe, born of an ancient evil. Ysera\'s noble brood has fallen victim to the old whisperings. It seems as if the Nightmare has broken through the realm and seeks a new host on Azeroth.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage - say Text 1'),
(17949,2,0,'Aye, Remulos. Prepare the mortal races.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage - say Text 2'),
(17949,3,0,'Cenarius fights at my side. Illidan sits atop his throne in the Outland - brooding. I am afraid that the loss to Arthas proved to be his breaking point. Madness has embraced him, Remulos. He replays the events in his mind a thousand times per day, but in his mind, he is the victor and Arthas is utterly defeated. He is too far gone, old friend. I fear that the time may soon come that our bond is tested and it will not be as it was at the Well in Zin-Azshari. ',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage - say Text 3'),
(17949,4,0,'Remulos, I am being drawn back... Tyrande... send her my love... Tell her I am safe. Tell her... Tell her I will return... Farewell...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage - say Text 4'),
(19412,0,0,'A cool breeze caresses your face. Gentle, melodic humming resonates throughout the chamber.\n',16,0,100,0,0,0,'D\'ore'),
(19419,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Raging Shardling'),
(19493,0,0,'I told you only to summon me if that stupid elf returned! What\'s this? No matter, you won\'t detain me long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Ekkorash the Inquisitor'),
(19666,0,0,'Never underestimate the other ethereal\'s greed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Shadow Lord Xiraxis'),
(20482,0,0,'Hostiles detected. Ending transmission.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Image of Commander Ameer'),
