(41739,0,0,'What could an orc as depraved as you enjoy more than killing Alliance, Utvoch?',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Sergeant Dontrag'),
(41739,1,0,'You are a sick, sick orc, Ut.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Sergeant Dontrag'),
(41739,2,0,'Yes, sir! Let\'s go Ut.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Sergeant Dontrag'),
(41740,0,0,'Few things I like more than killing Alliance.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Scout Utvoch'),
(41740,1,0,'You know I can\'t resist tauren women, Donty. They\'re my one weakness...',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Scout Utvoch'),
(42598,0,0,'Initiating cleanup ... ...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'GS-9x Multi-Bot'),
(42655,0,0,'The gnolls have failed, mistress. ',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42655,1,0,'But mistress, the admiral is sti...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42655,2,0,'Yes, mistress.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42655,3,0,'Moonbrook, mistress?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42680,0,0,'The rally is about to begin!',42,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(42680,1,0,'Gather, brothers and sisters! Come, all, and listen!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(42680,2,0,'Brothers. Sisters. We are ABANDONED - the orphaned children of Stormwind.',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,3,0,'Our "king" sits atop his throne made of gold and shrugs at our plight!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,4,0,'Meanwhile, our children die of starvation on these very streets!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,5,0,'HIS war, not ours, cost us our livelihood. WE paid for the Alliance\'s victories with our blood and the blood of our loved ones!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,6,0,'The time has come, brothers and sisters, to stop this injustice!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,7,0,'The government of Stormwind, of the ALLIANCE, must be made accountable for what it has done to us!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,8,0,'Today, we are reborn! Today, we take a stand as men and women, not nameless, faceless numbers!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42707,0,0,'Cover the door - we\'ve got him!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Twilight Nightblade'),
(42744,0,0,'Just tell me one thing, Vanessa.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(42744,1,0,'Why\'d you have the Furlbrows killed?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(42748,0,0,'Thank you, my dear.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(42749,0,0,'You bastards will burn for what you did.',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(42749,1,0,'Hope?  Like the hope Fandral had for bringing our people  back to glory?  Back to immortality?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(42749,2,0,'Hope is a cruel joke, played upon us by a harsh and uncaring world. There is no Hope, there is only Vanessa. Vanessa VanCleef.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(42749,3,0,'RISE UP BROTHERHOOD! THE DAWNING DAY IS UPON US!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(42749,4,0,'Tie them up.',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(42749,5,0,'Admiral, your hat.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(42749,6,0,'And you, $n, I will spare your life. You have done much to help our cause, albeit unwittingly, but the next time we meet it will be as enemies. ',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(42749,7,0,'I had no choice, lieutenant. They recognized me. The only people in the world who even knew I existed, recognized my face from when I was an infant.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(42749,8,0,'I took no pleasure in their deaths.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(42749,9,0,'Leave nothing but ashes in your wake, brothers! Burn Sentinel Hill to the ground!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(42750,0,0,'I don\'t like this, $n. Stay alert!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(42750,1,0,'Hope! Wha..',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42750,2,0,'$n, get to Stormwind. Tell King Wrynn everything. EVERYTHING! GO NOW!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(43197,0,0,'ROCK NOT SO HEAVY! PUNY HUMIES!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(43197,1,0,'Where trow? TROW ON BRIDGE??',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(43197,2,0,'OK! Me trow in water!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(43245,0,0,'Jin\'do the Hexxer!  It\'s been a while since I\'ve seen that mask.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43245,1,0,'What brings you out to my part of Stranglethorn?  I\'m not accustomed to taking visitors from the esteemed Zul\'Gurub.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43245,2,0,'What a shame... but not a concern for an old exile like Zanzil.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43245,3,0,'Friend?  You were among those who spit and threw stones, Jin\'do.  But let\'s let bygones be bygones, eh?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43245,4,0,'So your bat and your snake need Zanzil\'s help?  Very well.  I\'ll see you inside Zul\'Gurub... old friend.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43246,0,0,'You know well enough about why I\'m here, Zanzil.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43246,1,0,'The Gurubashi have fallen on hard times.  I live, and Mandokir has returned... but the rest of us are gone.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43246,2,0,'Well, Zanzil, I\'d like to make it your concern.  I\'ve recovered the bodies of High Priestess Jeklik and High Priest Venoxis.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43246,3,0,'I remember what you can do with those elixirs of yours.  Can your elixirs help out an old friend?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(43396,0,0,'Ah, Maloriak. How gracious of you to finally appear from that quarantine you call a laboratory. What have you got this time?',14,0,100,1,0,20091,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event23'),
(43396,1,0,'By all means, enlighten me. ',14,0,100,6,0,20092,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event24'),
(43396,2,0,' It appears as though your experiment has failed. That whelp has gone completely blind! Look at him.',14,0,100,1,0,20093,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event25'),
(43396,3,0,'LOOK AT HIM!',14,0,100,25,0,20156,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event26'),
(43396,4,0,'No, not yet.',14,0,100,274,0,20094,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event27'),
(43396,5,0,'This object of your chagrin may still prove... valuable... to me.',14,0,100,273,0,20095,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event28'),
(43396,6,0,'Leave now, pathetic alchemist. I anxiously await your next failure.',14,0,100,21,0,20096,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event29'),
(43404,0,0,'My sincerest apologies for the disturbance, my liege. But I believe I have something you may be very interested in!',14,0,100,2,0,19860,''),
(43404,1,0,'Yes, yes! ',14,0,100,273,0,19861,''),
(43404,2,0,'By extracting agents from the blood of various dragonflights I have created a salve that will bestow the wearer sight beyond sight!',14,0,100,1,0,19862,''),
(43404,3,0,'Senses beyond this realm of mortality!',14,0,100,5,0,19863,''),
(43404,4,0,'Atramedes! Your master beckons.',14,0,100,25,0,19864,''),
(43404,5,0,'I present to you experiment number 25463-D!',14,0,100,21,0,19865,''),
(43404,6,0,'How could this be?! I will dispose of him immediately! \n',14,0,100,6,0,19866,''),
(43404,7,0,'Yes, my lord.',14,0,100,16,0,19867,''),
(43735,0,0,'BEHOLD YOUR DOOM!',14,0,0,0,0,20396,'VO_BT_Monstrosity_Event01'),
(43735,1,0,'Annihilate....',14,0,0,0,0,20397,'VO_BT_Monstrosity_Event02'),
