(43735,3,0,'FEEL THE POWER!',14,0,0,0,0,20400,'VO_BT_Monstrosity_Event05'),
(44414,0,0,'Hellscream\'s involved, you say?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Durak'),
(44414,1,0,'Well then there is only one thing left to be done...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Durak'),
(44414,2,0,'This is all happening sooner than I would have liked.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Durak'),
(44414,3,0,'I am afraid that you, $n, have outgrown your usefulness...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Durak'),
(44904,0,0,'Shapeshift!  Here come de moonfire!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,0,1,'Shapeshift!  Get ready for de moonfire!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,0,2,'Shapeshift!  Here it comes, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,1,0,'Shapeshift!  Zen\'Kiki\'s ready to pounce!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,1,1,'Shapeshift!  Time for cat form!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,1,2,'Shapeshift!  Get ready to taste my claws!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,2,0,'Shapeshift!  Zen\'Kiki will absorb de damage!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,2,1,'Shapeshift!  Time for bear form!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,2,2,'Shapeshift!  Over here, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,3,0,'Shapeshift!  Uh oh... wait a minute here...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,3,1,'Shapeshift!  Oh no!  Not again...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,3,2,'Shapeshift!  Try to swim away now, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,4,0,'I\'ll get him!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,4,1,'Am I hitting him?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,5,0,'Get over here, you coward!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,5,1,'No, hit me!  Over here, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,6,0,'Can Zen\'Kiki get a little nudge?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,6,1,'Why you guys upside down?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,7,0,'Zen\'kiki\'s real sorry about this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,7,1,'This isn\'t right.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,8,0,'Alright, here I go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44904,8,1,'Ready to go, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45277,0,0,'Drinking a healing potion!  I won\'t be able to use another one for a while!',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Feralas Sentinel'),
(45277,1,0,'Farewell for now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Feralas Sentinel'),
(45277,2,0,'The creature is gaining power from the ancestral Grimtotem!  We must put them to rest if we are to defeat this beast!',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Feralas Sentinel'),
(45278,0,0,'Hail.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Freewind Brave'),
(45278,1,0,'Drinking a healing potion!  I won\'t be able to use another one for a while!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Freewind Brave'),
(45278,2,0,'Until we meet again.',12,0,100,3,0,0,'Freewind Brave'),
(45278,3,0,'The creature is gaining power from the ancestral Grimtotem!  We must put them to rest if we are to defeat this beast!\n',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Freewind Brave'),
(45447,0,0,'Thank you for the gifts. Let us see if you are worthy, $c!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arikara'),
(45447,1,0,'Stop! You have bested my wind serpent.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arikara'),
(45447,2,0,'I have been taken prisoner by the Twilight\'s Hammer.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arikara'),
(45447,3,0,'I\'m not certain where. Start with their western base overlooking Highperch.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arikara'),
(45715,0,0,'I owe you my life.  My people have paid a high price for defying Deathwing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45715,0,1,'I\'d only heard about your kind in stories, $r.  I never thought I\'d owe my life to one of you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45715,0,2,'I... *cough*  I thank you, stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45741,0,0,'I will be goin\' now.  I have no reason to remain here.  I may be undead, but my will is my own.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45741,1,0,'I will see you in green fields on the other side, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(45878,0,0,'Lorna, is that how you greet old friends? ',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(45878,1,0,'My kingdom? My kingdom is no more.',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(45878,2,0,'Your father and Greymane saw to that... No, Gilneas died when they allowed murderous beasts to reign free. Unchecked.',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(45878,3,0,'Now lay down your arms and surrender. We are not here to kill you. Not yet.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46041,0,0,'You will be punished for this transgression, thief!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46042,0,0,'You will be punished for this transgression, thief!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46191,0,0,'Hey now!  Why do you get to sit in front?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(46191,1,0,'Who says you won the bet?  We haven\'t compared tallies yet.',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(46191,2,0,'I\'m pretty sure I killed six.',12,0,100,24,0,0,''),
(46191,3,0,'H... how did you know that?',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(46191,4,0,'Don\'t do this, Tarenar.',12,0,100,274,0,0,''),
(46191,5,0,'You remember damn well enough what it was.',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(46191,6,0,'<Sigh>... "The Paladin Pals".',12,0,100,24,0,0,''),
(46191,7,0,'Maybe now I don\'t want to.  Maybe I like it better sitting back here with my new friend.  It smells like horses up there.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46191,8,0,'We just rested a few minutes ago!  Let\'s just go to Light\'s Hope Chapel!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(46191,9,0,'We won\'t lose a horse.  Look at them!  They look exactly like they did when we started.',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(46191,10,0,'This hardly seems fair!!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(46191,11,0,'Why do I have to sit up top with all the stuff?!',12,0,100,15,0,0,''),
(46191,12,0,'Hey!  I oughtta bounce one of these trunks off of your head, Tarenar.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46191,13,0,'Oh shut up, you dolt.  YOU probably want to kiss her a hundred times.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46191,14,0,'If you don\'t mind my askin\', what do you do that requires walking so much?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(46191,15,0,'So you\'re part of the Argent Crusade, eh?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(46191,16,0,'Think you can put in the good word for us?  We\'re looking to join the order.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46191,17,0,'NOOOOOOO!  Stopped again!',12,0,100,15,0,0,''),
(46191,18,0,'Walking, eh...?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46192,0,0,'Gidwin, you can sit in front with me next time.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46192,1,0,'There\'s a tower coming up on our left.  What do you say we stop and rest a bit?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46192,2,0,'The roads here are rough, Gidwin.  I don\'t want to risk losing a horse.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46192,3,0,'Here we are!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46192,4,0,'Because you\'re the bravest, dear.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46192,5,0,'I know I promised you the front seat, Giddy, but we have an elderly guest.  I\'m sorry.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46192,6,0,'Do you normally walk these roads alone?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(46192,7,0,'Of course I\'m not just going to drop you off, Master Highbeacon.  We\'ll be happy to wait for you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,0,0,'Shotgun!',12,0,100,275,0,0,''),
(46193,1,0,'Because I won our bet.  And because I called shotgun.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,2,0,'Fine.  I killed five zombies.  And they were huge.  How many undead did you kill?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,3,0,'I\'m going to bet that you only killed four.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,4,0,'I didn\'t.  You just told me!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(46193,5,0,'So seriously, how did your undead hunting go?  I want to hear stories.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,6,0,'Gidwin?  Are you ignoring me?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(46193,7,0,'Giddy... you\'re mad at me, aren\'t you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,8,0,'Remember when we were kids, Gidwin?  We would spend all day pretending to fight the trolls, or the murlocs, or the girls.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,9,0,'We had a name we called ourselves... what was it?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(46193,10,0,'I\'m dead serious.  I\'ve completely forgotten.',12,0,100,274,0,0,''),
(46193,11,0,'Actually, I agree with Fiona.',12,0,100,274,0,0,''),
(46193,12,0,'The Argent Crusade can wait for us a little while longer.  Besides... our guest may want to get off the caravan soon.',12,0,100,274,0,0,''),
(46193,13,0,'Because you\'re short.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,14,0,'Fiona, I must warn you: Gidwin only wants to sit in front because he wants to kiss you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46193,15,0,'Do not!',14,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(46193,16,0,'Noble work.',12,0,100,273,0,0,''),
(46193,17,0,'Whoah... he lets you call him Max?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,0,0,'Ahem!  I, ah, appreciate the ride, Madam Fiona.  It\'s nice to get off my feet for once.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,1,0,'Yes, I do, though it was easier when I was younger.  These days, I have to be more careful.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,2,0,'I service the five Argent towers.  Mostly repairs and maintenance, and some minor magical work.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,3,0,'Without proper upkeep, buildings within the plaguelands tend to... waste away.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,4,0,'I find it satisfying.  I enjoy working with my hands.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,5,0,'By the way, if any of you need anything repaired, let me know.  I am at your service.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,6,0,'Certainly.  I don\'t make it out to Light\'s Hope very often anymore, but when you arrive, tell Max Tyrosus that I sent you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,7,0,'Ma\'am, would you mind dropping me off at Light\'s Shield Tower, just up ahead?  I have to stop here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46194,8,0,'Light\'s Hope isn\'t far, young paladin.  Might I suggest walking?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46276,0,0,'I\'m afraid your friend won\'t be waking up any time soon.  I always sedate my croc\'s food.  I hate to see them struggle with their meal.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46276,1,0,'But perhaps I will make an exception for you.  Let the crocs out!  IT\'S FEEDING TIME!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46276,2,0,'Bah!  Mere luck!  My pets will make mincemeat out of you yet!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46276,3,0,'Enough!  I grow tired of you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46277,0,0,'Heroes, you are not alone in this dark place!',14,0,0,0,0,21588,'VO_BT_Caelestrasz_Intro01'),
(46277,1,0,'Heroes!  My power wanes....',14,0,0,0,0,21589,'VO_BT_Caelestrasz_Losing01'),
(46277,2,0,'Sintharia, your master owes me a great debt -- one that I intend to extract from his consort\'s hide!',14,0,0,0,0,21590,'VO_BT_Caelestrasz_Phase2'),
(46277,3,0,'The fires dim, champions....  Take this, the last of my power.  Succeed where I have failed.  Avenge me.  Avenge the world....',14,0,0,0,0,21591,'VO_BT_Caelestrasz_Phase3'),
(46277,4,0,'Flame of Life!  Burn within me and renew my vigor!',14,0,0,0,0,21592,'VO_BT_Caelestrasz_Recharge01'),
(46277,5,0,'You are weakening, Sintharia!  Accept the inevitable!',14,0,0,0,0,21593,'VO_BT_Caelestrasz_Winning01'),
(46277,6,0,'All is lost....  Forgive me, my Queen....',14,0,0,0,0,21598,'VO_BT_Caelestrasz_Death'),
(46900,0,0,'Back, vermin! (Insects! Weak and small!)',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46900,1,0,'Look, mortal, upon the instrument of your undoing. (The Hammer, hand of the Gods Below.) Forged of molten blood... (...gift of the master. His gift!) Shaped upon the Last Altar of Storm.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46900,2,0,'The Hammer of Twilight. (The Hammer of Twilight!) Commissioned by the Aspect of Death. It is the breaker of worlds. It is not yours to wield. (Kill the intruders!) Kill them all!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46900,3,0,'What Deathwing has set in motion... (...no man can stop.) No man! Least of all you wretches. (Show them. Show them their end!)',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46942,0,0,'Hold your blade, adventurer!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46942,1,0,'This beast leads the Riverpaw gnoll gang and may be the key to ending gnoll aggression in Elwynn.',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(46942,2,0,'We\'re taking him into custody in the name of King Varian Wrynn.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(46942,3,0,'Take us to the Stockades, Andromath.',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(46943,0,0,'General Marcus Jonathan!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46943,1,0,'Wow!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46965,0,0,'Mortals! You dare breach our inner sanctum. (Unbelievers. Heretics! Burn burn)\n You cross a threshold from which there is no return. (burn burn the heretics will burn.)',14,0,0,0,0,22054,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent01'),
(46965,1,0,'Halfus! Hear me! (The Master calls, the Master wants.) Protect our secrets, Halfus. Destroy the intruders. (Murder for His glory. Murder for His hunger.)',14,0,0,0,0,22055,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent02'),
(46965,2,0,' Flesh and sinew, weak but proud. Dare they part the Master\'s shroud? They stumble fumble groping blind. Finding fate and chaos intertwined.',14,0,0,0,0,22056,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent03'),
(46965,3,0,'Brothers in chaos, the Twilight has come! (Shadows lengthen, endless night.) Deathwing has sundered this world. (Doors once opened never close.) So that its true Lords may return. (The Master comes, He comes He comes.)',14,0,0,0,0,22057,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent04'),
(46965,4,0,'You are His chosen ones. (He calls you, He knows you). Born of flesh- (flesh) purified by blood- (blood) destined for immortality!',14,0,0,0,0,22058,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent05'),
(46965,5,0,'Heed His call! Cast down the heretics!',14,0,0,0,0,22059,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent06'),
(46965,6,0,'Brothers of the Hammer, to me! (Their will is still their own.) The unbelievers still stand. Destroy them! (Crush their bodies, crush their will.)',14,0,0,0,0,22060,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent07'),
(46965,7,0,'Mortals, you merely separate the wheat from the chaff. (Unworthy, unworthy).',14,0,0,0,0,22062,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent09'),
(46965,8,0,'Valiona, Theralion, put them in their place.',14,0,0,0,0,22063,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent10'),
(46965,9,0,'(Come closer, closer.  Let us see your faces. All will be humbled before his power.)',14,0,0,0,0,22064,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent11'),
(46965,10,0,'Welcome, mortals. (Frail little children). Few have laid eyes on this inner sanctum. (They reach out to touch the fire!)',14,0,0,0,0,22065,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent12'),
(46965,11,0,'It is here the chosen realize their destiny. (One with eternity). And it is here that you will realize yours.(End of the flesh. End of the flesh)!',14,0,0,0,0,22066,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent13'),
(46965,12,0,'Brothers of Twilight! The Hammer calls to you! (Fire water earth air). Leave your mortal shell behind. (Fire water earth air). Embrace your new forms for here and everafter! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate). And use your gifts to destroy the unbelievers. (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate)!!',14,0,0,0,0,22067,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent14'),
(46965,13,0,'Foolish mortals-(Usurper\'s children!) nothing you have done- (Spawn of a lesser god!) I am TRYING to speak here. (Words, words, words. The Master wants murder.) ALL falls to chaos. ALL will be destroyed. (Chaos, chaos!) Your work here today changes nothing. (Chaos, chaos, all things end) No mortal may see what you have and live. Your end has come.',14,0,0,0,0,22068,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent15'),
(46986,0,0,'Some have spent decades meditating upon this mystery, Avuun. I do not wish the same fate upon you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46986,1,0,'The Light wishes suffering on none, my child. But it does not reign unopposed in our realm.',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(46986,2,0,'Even now, the true battle between the forces of Light and Darkness approaches. We will all be called to join, and in the face of this conflict, all mortal suffering will be meaningless.',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(46986,3,0,'Magtoor, you have endured your plight bravely. Are you ready to return to the embrace of the Light?',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(46986,4,0,'Then may the Light save you and raise you up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(46986,5,0,'Remember, Avuun. Not all who wander are lost.',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(47001,0,0,'Even now, nothing. Why? Why would the Light forsake the innocent?',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(47001,1,0,'Prophet Velen!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(47001,2,0,'...thank you, Prophet. You have given both of us great comfort. I will continue my work, in faith and memory of Magtoor.',12,0,100,273,0,0,''),
(47249,0,0,'Very vell, zhen. Let me just check my notes vone lasht time...',12,0,100,396,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,1,0,'Mmm-hmmm, yes, yes... simple enough...\n',12,0,100,396,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,2,0,'Oh, Gobbles! Ve\'re ready to begin! Come, come!',14,0,100,22,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,3,0,'Hold on, Gobbles! Shtand back everyvone!',12,0,100,22,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,4,0,'VHAT!?',14,0,100,388,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,5,0,'My poor Gobbles...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,6,0,'Vhat could haf possibly gone vrong? I followed every lasht detail...',14,0,100,22,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,7,0,'Vait a shekkont! Vhat\'s zhis!?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,8,0,'You only brought me eight idols!',14,0,100,397,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,9,0,'Zhe ritual shpecifically calls for NINE!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,10,0,'NINE! NINE! NINE! NINE! NINE!!!',14,0,100,5,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47249,11,0,'Out of my sight, vizh you! Auch...',14,0,100,18,0,0,'Commander Schnottz'),
(47281,0,0,'Lunk will ride you now!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47281,0,1,'Look out spider!  Here come Lunk!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47281,0,2,'Lunk ride spider now!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47281,0,3,'You hold still, spider!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47281,0,4,'Spider tummy time!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47281,1,0,'Spider left some venom on Lunk\'s tummy.  You want?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47281,1,1,'I got some venom for you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47281,1,2,'Lunk got you some venom with his tummy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47281,2,0,'You hurt Lunk\'s feelings when you kill.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47299,0,0,'Lunk tired of all this killing!  Lunk quits!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk');
INSERT INTO `tmp_548_creature_text` (`entry`,`groupid`,`id`,`text`,`type`,`language`,`probability`,`emote`,`duration`,`sound`,`comment`) VALUES
(47299,1,0,'Lunk going to find some real adventures!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Lunk'),
(47301,0,0,'You dwarves are worthless!  You come to Ragnaros seeking ascendance, but you have nothing to offer!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Image of Archduke Calcinder'),
(47301,1,0,'Nothing to offer, except your backs and your shovels.  So you will dig.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Image of Archduke Calcinder'),
(47301,2,0,'Dig wide, dig deep.  Seek out the places of fire beneath the world.  My brothers and sisters yearn to be free.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Image of Archduke Calcinder'),
(47301,3,0,'Succeed, and you may ascend after all.  Fail, and burn.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Image of Archduke Calcinder'),
(47333,0,0,'Here, I stealed this from little dwarf.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(47333,0,1,'He will be sleepy for a while.  Lunk know.  Lunk do before.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(47333,0,2,'Here, you can have dwarf\'s things.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(47333,0,3,'You take dwarf\'s things.  No need to kill.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(47333,0,4,'Sitting easier than killing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(47333,0,5,'Here you go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(47442,0,0,'I will do this ONE thing that you ask of me, quest giver. Pray I find more menial tasks to accomplish or you will be hearing from me again and I assure you that my commentary on forums of public opinion will be most unkind.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(47443,0,0,'Yes, cowardly quest giver, sit atop your pale horse while Orkus brings glory to the Horde! I shall return with a thousand skulls!',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(47444,0,0,'NORTH! GOT IT! THANKS! BYE! THANKS!',12,0,100,3,0,0,''),
(47558,0,0,'Shh! They can hear you, dummy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(47558,1,0,'Ow! Now they can see us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(47736,0,0,'The Elder Crone rubs her wrists as she flashes a toothy grin your way.',16,0,100,432,0,0,'Magatha Grimtotem'),
(47736,1,0,'I\'m surprised that you made it this far.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Magatha Grimtotem'),
(47736,2,0,'I suppose I should thank you for freeing me. We\'ll soon see if you think that was a wise decision.',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Magatha Grimtotem'),
(47736,3,0,'Meet me just outside of the Twilight Withering down the path to the east.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Magatha Grimtotem'),
(47836,0,0,'You can follow me to the Loading Room, $n.',12,0,100,25,0,0,'S.A.F.E. Operative'),
(48022,0,0,'Here I am, $g sir:madam; $n!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Salhet'),
(48160,0,0,'Your death will tell a different story!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Xaravan'),
(48397,0,0,'Ugh, the lok\'tar must have been cooking up a turd - which would explain the smell.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(48397,1,0,'By Hellscream\'s axe!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(48397,2,0,'You face Kingslayer Orkus now, dwarf!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(48397,3,0,'KASHA! Your master needs you!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(48403,0,0,'Oy, \'Linda, where are we meetin\' up with this Ivar Bloodfang fella? An\' what in Bronzebeard\'s name is that terrible smell?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(48403,1,0,'Look there, \'Linda! What in the...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(48407,0,0,'They are massing at Purgation Isle, just west of us here, off the coast. We are to meet them there, general.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(48407,1,0,'As for the smell... *Balinda sniffs at the air* I think it\'s coming from over there...',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(48487,0,0,'What is going on in here?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Whisperwind Druid'),
(48487,1,0,'The Arch Druid... how in the world...?',12,0,100,274,0,0,'Whisperwind Druid'),
(48487,2,0,'I... I must tell the others. You should find Huntress Selura right away.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Whisperwind Druid'),
(48752,0,0,'Begone infidels, you are not welcome here!',12,0,100,0,0,19735,''),
(48752,0,1,'Death is only the beginning!',12,0,100,0,0,19733,''),
(48752,0,2,'May peace find you now.',12,0,100,0,0,19738,''),
(48752,0,3,'The heavens take you!',12,0,100,0,0,19736,''),
(49226,0,0,'Welcome to my personal sanctum, heroes! I hope you find the accommodations to your liking. Herein you will find many of my failed experiments and ultimately my greatest triumph!',14,0,0,0,0,20090,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event22'),
(49226,1,0,'Mortals that fancy themselves HEROES have entered the Broken Hall. Oh, I do hope this "raid" will amuse me more than the last.',14,0,0,0,0,23379,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ZoneIntro01'),
(49226,2,0,'I should have known better than to rely on something so stupidly named to entertain me for long.',14,0,0,0,0,23373,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronDead01'),
(49226,3,0,'Hmm... the Omnotron Defense System. Centuries ago these constructs were considered the Dwarves\' greatest technical achievements. With so many counters to each construct\'s attacks, I\'ll have to rectify these designs for them to provide me any entertainment.',14,0,0,0,0,23374,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronIntro01'),
(49226,4,0,'You would like to move away from that, wouldn\'t you? Too bad.',14,0,0,0,0,23375,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell01'),
(49226,5,0,'Stupid Dwarves and your fascination with runes! Why would you create something that would help your enemy?',14,0,0,0,0,23376,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell02'),
(49226,6,0,'Lightning Conductor works much better in a crowd, yes?',14,0,0,0,0,23377,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell03'),
(49226,7,0,'Were you planning on using Toxitron\'s chemicals to damage the other constructs? Clever plan, let me ruin that for you.',14,0,0,0,0,23378,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell04'),
(49226,8,0,'That malfunctioning piece of junk was murder on the repair bills.',14,0,0,0,0,20086,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event18'),
(49226,9,0,'I found this fascinating specimen in the lava underneath this very room. Magmaw should provide an adequate challenge for your pathetic little band.',14,0,0,0,0,23367,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawIntro01'),
(49226,10,0,'Finally someone to deal with that unsightly pest! You have my thanks, "heroes."',14,0,0,0,0,20085,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event17'),
(49226,11,0,'You won? How... disappointing. I could have easily watched you all continue to stand in the fire.',14,0,0,0,0,23366,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawDead01'),
(49226,12,0,'Inconceivable! You may actually defeat my lava worm! Perhaps I can help... tip the scales. ',14,0,0,0,0,23368,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawLowHealth'),
(49226,13,0,'On second thought, what fun is an "adequate" challenge?',14,0,0,0,0,23369,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawSummon01'),
(49226,14,0,'Maloriak, try not to lose to these mortals. Semicompetent help is SO hard to create.',14,0,0,0,0,23372,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MaloriakIntro01'),
(49226,15,0,'Your mixtures are weak, Maloriak! They need a bit more... kick!',14,0,0,0,0,23370,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Maloriak01'),
(49226,16,0,'Congratulations! Allow me to grant you a title befitting the amazing achievement you just performed. Henceforth you shall be known as the "Slayer of Stupid, Incompetent, and Disappointing Minions."',14,0,0,0,0,23371,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MaloriakDead01'),
(49226,17,0,'We never did see eye to eye... Good riddance I say!',14,0,0,0,0,20089,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event21'),
(49226,18,0,'You should have been disposed of a long time ago.',14,0,0,0,0,23357,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesDead'),
(49226,19,0,'These shields are proving quite the nuisance.',14,0,0,0,0,23358,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesGong'),
(49226,20,0,'Atramedes, the heroes are right THERE!',14,0,0,0,0,23359,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesImp01'),
(49226,21,0,'Atramedes, are you going deaf as well as blind? Hurry up and kill them all.',14,0,0,0,0,23360,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesIntro'),
(49226,22,0,'Now that was really unnecessary.',14,0,0,0,0,20087,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event19'),
(49226,23,0,'Impressive. You have managed to destroy one of my most horrific creations, a task I had thought impossible until now.',14,0,0,0,0,20088,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event20'),
(49226,24,0,'Hmm... a shame to lose that experiment.',14,0,0,0,0,23361,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronDead01'),
(49226,25,0,'Ah, Chimaeron, truly a living testament to my scientific prowess. I reworked and twisted his form countless times over the years, and the final result is truly something to behold.',14,0,0,0,0,23362,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronIntro01'),
(49226,26,0,'Oh, you were expecting something else to happen just then, weren\'t you? Let\'s see how well YOU adapt after a new set of "adjustments," shall we?',14,0,0,0,0,23363,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell01'),
(49226,27,0,'Stop fighting yourself this instant, Chimaeron!',14,0,0,0,0,23364,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell02'),
(49226,28,0,'This fight has gotten a bit stale; allow me to spice things up!',14,0,0,0,0,23365,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell03'),
(49255,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Ramkahen Ranger'),
(49426,0,0,'Hi, $n! What do you think about my new gear?',12,0,100,23,0,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),
(49426,1,0,'They\'re making me into a Deathguard. Can you believe it?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),
(49426,2,0,'I\'ll probably be staying here in Deathknell. If things work out though... who knows? Maybe I\'ll get to meet the Dark Lady herself.',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),
(49426,3,0,'How about you? I\'ve heard that Sarvis is going to send you off to Calston Estate. Big assignment, eh?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),
(49426,4,0,'Well, I won\'t hold you up. It\'s been a pleasure. I hope our paths cross again soon.',12,0,100,66,0,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),
(49634,0,0,'At the bottom of the ocean even light must die.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,1,'The silent, sleeping, staring houses in the backwoods always dream. It would be merciful to tear them down.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,2,'There is no sharp distinction between the real and the unreal.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,3,'Even death may die.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,4,'There is a little lamb lost in dark woods.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,5,'All places, all things have souls. All souls can be devoured.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,6,'What can change the nature of a man?',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,7,'The stars sweep chill currents that make men shiver in the dark.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,8,'You will all be alone in the end.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,9,'Do you dream while you sleep or is it an escape from the horrors of reality?',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,10,'Look around. They will all betray you. Flee screaming into the black forest.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,11,'In the land of Ny\'alotha there is only sleep.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,12,'In the sleeping city of Ny\'alotha walk only mad things.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,13,'Ny\'alotha is a city of old, terrible, unnumbered crimes.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,14,'Y\'knath k\'th\'rygg k\'yi mrr\'ungha gr\'mula.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,15,'The void sucks at your soul. It is content to feast slowly.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,16,'The drowned god\'s heart is black ice.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,17,'It is standing right behind you. Do not move. Do not breathe.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,18,'Have you had the dream again? A black goat with seven eyes that watches from the outside.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,19,'In the sunken city, he lays dreaming.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,20,'Open me! Open me! Open me! Then only will you know peace.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,21,'You resist. You cling to your life as if it actually matters. You will learn.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,22,'The tortured spirits of your ancestors cling to you, screaming in silence. Apparently they are quite numerous.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,23,'The fish know all the secrets. They know the cold. They know the dark.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(49634,0,24,'The giant rook watches from the dead trees. Nothing breathes beneath his shadow.',15,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(50374,0,0,'What... what\'s happening to me? Why have you done this to me?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
(50374,1,0,'I should be dead and to death I will return!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
(50374,2,0,'I never asked for this! Leave me alone!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
(50374,3,0,'What magic is this that turns back the hand of death?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
(50374,4,0,'If the Banshee Queen has offered me this chance, I will gladly serve.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
(50374,5,0,'This is Lady Sylvanas\'s doing?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
(50374,6,0,'What use has the Dark Lady for me?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
(50374,7,0,'I... I don\'t remember... Why have you done this?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
(50374,8,0,'%s commits suicide.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Risen Dead'),
