(56660,0,0,'$p, where\'s Master Shang?',12,0,100,6,0,27297,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56660,1,0,'Bah, let a pandaren hope, would you?  I\'m going to miss the old man.',12,0,100,1,0,27298,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56660,2,0,'When am I not respectful?  You hurt me, Aysa.',12,0,100,6,0,27299,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56660,3,0,'A thorn?  And I left my tweezers at home.',12,0,100,6,0,27300,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56660,4,0,'How could such a thing cause pain to something so large?',12,0,100,6,0,27301,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56660,5,0,'Are you seeing what I\'m seeing?!  Is that a boat?!',12,0,100,5,0,27302,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56660,6,0,'And those aren\'t pandaren down there.  They\'ve got no fur.',12,0,100,5,0,27303,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56661,0,0,'...Ji, they were in the Wood of Staves.  You know where Master Shang is now.',12,0,100,1,0,27431,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,1,0,'Ji, be respectful when we speak to Shen-zin Su.',12,0,100,1,0,27432,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,2,0,'I might if you embarrass us.',12,0,100,1,0,27433,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,3,0,'Shen-zin Su, we are the descendants of Liu Lang.  We\'ve sensed your pain, and we want to help.',14,0,100,1,0,27434,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,4,0,'What ails you Shen-zin Su?  What can we do?',14,0,100,6,0,27435,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,5,0,'Of course, Shen-zin Su!  But your shell is large, and I do not know where this thorn could be.',14,0,100,1,0,27436,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,6,0,'We will find it, and we will remove it.  You have our word!',14,0,100,1,0,27437,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,7,0,'We\'ll know soon enough.',12,0,100,1,0,27438,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,8,0,'It is a boat... a whole airship!  That\'s a bigger thorn than I was expecting.',12,0,100,1,0,27439,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,9,0,'Someone has crashed into our island.  Removing this thorn may be more complicated than we thought.',12,0,100,1,0,27440,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56661,10,0,'We should let Elder Shaopai know and then plan our next move.',12,0,100,1,0,27441,'Aysa Cloudsinger'),
(56663,0,0,'Or if you want to wander the woods a while, Aysa and I can hang out here.  You know... just the two of us.',12,0,100,1,0,27296,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56762,0,0,'Be free of doubt, priestess...',14,0,100,0,0,28559,'Yu\'lon'),
