(57155,0,0,'I feared that this day would come. I will pack up my things.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57161,0,0,'I see. I\'d hoped that we could wait out this invasion, but if the authorities want us to leave, we will leave.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57161,1,0,'Ying, Huizhong... gather your things. We\'re leaving the farm until it\'s safe.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57161,2,0,'I don\'t know, dear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57161,3,0,'Are you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57183,0,0,'%s sighs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57183,1,0,'I am a farmer, $c. It\'s all I know.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57183,2,0,'All we have is our land. And that commander wants us to give it up to the mantid?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57183,3,0,'I will not do it. My grandfather knew what he was getting into when he first planted seed in the shadow of the Serpent\'s Spine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57183,4,0,'I have my wife, two strong daughters, and two strong sons. Thank you, but we can protect this farm ourselves.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57638,0,0,'The reeds of the Singing Pools are the hardest in all of the land, but they are as air before my mighty brow.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57638,1,0,'Many have tested my claim, and I yet stand proven.',12,0,100,2,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57669,0,0,'Our crafters build the finest wooden planks.  They would weather the most brutal of storms.  But they are as water before the storm of my crushing skull.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57669,1,0,'Nothing made by pandaren hands can withstand me.',12,0,100,2,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57670,0,0,'These are the densest stones across all of Shen-zin Su, yet they are as nothing before my mighty head.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57670,1,0,'Any who yet doubt my strength are simply foolish.',12,0,100,2,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57681,0,0,'You have no idea how long I was in there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57681,0,1,'Thanks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57681,0,2,'Better get out of here before he comes by again!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57681,0,3,'I suppose there are worse fates than being stuck forever inside a beer barrel.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57681,0,4,'Ach! The light... it hurts our eyes...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57681,0,5,'Finally!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(57692,0,0,'This is magnificent!  I\'ve never seen craftsmanship so fine.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57692,1,0,'There is only one thing to do.  I must smash it!  Once and for all, all shall know the power of my mighty brow.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57692,2,0,'Oh... my head... it hurts so badly!  I\'ve... the pillar must contain enormous power... perhaps stronger even than my brow...',12,0,100,18,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(57692,3,0,'I\'m... I\'m just going to lie down a while... until this headache goes away.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Jojo Ironbrow'),
(58206,0,0,'Look at that. The little guy left you some purified water.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58224,0,0,'You fail to bend the knee to our power? Then die like the vermin you are.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58572,0,0,'You have given much of your time, patience, and love, $n. Behold your serpent now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58606,0,0,'Halt, supplicant! These waters belong to the Thunder King. Your presence is unwelcome.',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(58606,1,0,'Guardians! Kill these intruders.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58666,0,0,'KOR! NOOOOOOOO!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58666,1,0,'I think we have both lost enough today, old elf. See to your dead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58826,0,0,'I can allow this no longer!',14,0,100,0,0,27747,'Zao Sunseeker'),
(58826,1,0,'The blistering heat must have dulled my senses... mirages! All of you!',14,0,100,0,0,27748,'Zao Sunseeker'),
(58833,0,0,'F... father? No! Not for me! Not for this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58970,0,0,'I spent so long trying to find a way to extend my life that I forgot to live it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58970,1,0,'And now this... folly... would cost my daughter her life.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58970,2,0,'The water may not create life, but at least it will let me transfer it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58970,3,0,'I love you, my little Lyalia.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58975,0,0,'What now, Sunwalker?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58975,1,0,'Agreed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(58975,2,0,'Lyalia! I am so sorry, my child.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
