(61792,2,0,'Yes... of course.',12,0,100,24,0,27392,''),
(61792,3,0,'Careful, $p! You do not want to hurt your new king...',12,0,100,274,0,27393,''),
(62081,0,0,'Yes, warchief.',12,0,100,2,0,27290,''),
(62081,1,0,'I... I believe so. Yes.',12,0,100,273,0,27291,''),
(62081,2,0,'Well fought. I don\'t think I could have survived that battle without you at my back.',12,0,100,0,0,27293,''),
(62087,0,0,'You\'ve made a wise decision to join my Horde.',12,0,100,273,0,30746,''),
(62087,1,0,'There are some that would call us barbarians... the "mongrel races" of Azeroth.',12,0,100,396,0,30747,''),
(62087,2,0,'They are ignorant, and blind to reality. Look around you, pandaren.',12,0,100,274,0,30748,''),
(62087,3,0,'You will find no better partner in battle than an orc.',12,0,100,397,0,30749,''),
(62087,4,0,'The tauren have made themselves useful. Look - this one is a shaman.',12,0,100,6,0,30750,''),
(62087,5,0,'Even a blood elf can hold a sword.',12,0,100,396,0,30751,''),
(62087,6,0,'Do you see it? Everyone in my Horde earns their keep. You and your friends will be no exception.',12,0,100,396,0,30752,''),
(62087,7,0,'Do you understand this, pandaren?',12,0,100,6,0,30753,''),
(62087,8,0,'Hm. Good.',12,0,100,0,0,30754,''),
(62087,9,0,'Moving on. I know that you are not the only pandaren to escape from that island.',12,0,100,396,0,30755,''),
(62087,10,0,'Some of your kind chose to join the Alliance.',12,0,100,14,0,30756,''),
(62087,11,0,'They are now your enemies.',12,0,100,397,0,30757,''),
(62087,12,0,'You may have had friends and kin who chose to cast their lot with the enemies of the Horde. They are no longer your friends... no longer your family.',12,0,100,396,0,30758,''),
(62087,13,0,'The minute they put on that Alliance tabard, they died. I will NOT tolerate any lingering ties across enemy lines. Traitors to the Horde will die a traitor\'s death!',12,0,100,274,0,30759,''),
(62087,14,0,'Do I make myself clear?',12,0,100,5,0,30760,''),
(62087,15,0,'Good.',12,0,100,0,0,30761,''),
(62087,16,0,'Meet me in the Valley of Honor. I have a gift for you.',12,0,100,396,0,30762,''),
(62087,17,0,'Welcome to the Ring of Valor, pandaren. Make yourself comfortable while I finish preparing.',14,0,100,0,0,30735,''),
(62087,18,0,'Hah! It looks like we\'re ready. Now, newcomers... prepare to fight!',14,0,100,0,0,30736,''),
(62087,19,0,'This is my gift to you: a gift, and a trial.',14,0,100,0,0,30737,''),
(62087,20,0,'I\'ve heard stories about the legendary pandaren and their exotic fighting styles. Now I want to see them.',14,0,100,0,0,30738,''),
(62087,21,0,'This is a rare opportunity, pandaren. Prove your might to the Warchief of the Horde!',14,0,100,0,0,30739,''),
