(64812,0,0,'Very good. Let\'s talk.',12,0,100,0,0,29136,'WRATHION_INTRO'),
(64812,1,0,'Tong! Drinks, please.',12,0,100,0,0,29137,'TONG_DRINKS'),
(64812,2,0,'My father, Deathwing, tried to destroy the whole of Azeroth.',12,0,100,0,0,29138,'ABOUT_DEATHWING_1'),
(64812,3,0,'He was misguided, of course, but he was right about one thing: Our world is... so fragile.',12,0,100,0,0,29139,'ABOUT_DEATHWING_2'),
(64812,4,1,'We are a point of light in a universe of shadow. A candle in a tempest.',12,0,100,0,0,29140,'AZEROTH_SCENE_1'),
(64812,5,0,'Sometimes I think it was the very precariousness of our world that drove my father to madness.',12,0,100,0,0,29141,'AZEROTH_SCENE_2'),
(64812,6,0,'Ah, thank you Tong.',12,0,100,0,0,29142,'TONG_HOLDING_CUP'),
(64812,7,0,'Now, to my point: I believe we are headed towards a reckoning. And no, I am not talking about the current conflict between the Alliance and the Horde.',12,0,100,0,0,29143,'WRATHION_OPINION'),
(64812,8,0,'Believe me - what Garrosh Hellscream achieved in Theramore is nothing compared to the horrors that are even now bearing down on our fragile home.',12,0,100,0,0,29144,'ABOUT_GARROSH'),
(64812,9,0,'But the war deeply troubles me. Do you see my concern?',12,0,100,0,0,29145,'AZEROTH_SCENE_3'),
(64812,10,0,'A divided Azeroth cannot possibly stand against the darkness.',12,0,100,0,0,29146,'AZEROTH_SCENE_4'),
(64812,11,0,'This war has to end. Soon. Before it consumes our strength!',12,0,100,0,0,29147,'ABOUT_WAR'),
(64812,12,0,'You can rest assured that my loyalties lie with your Horde.',12,0,100,0,0,29149,'FACTION_H'),
(64812,13,0,'I want you to know that your Alliance has my full and unwavering support in this campaign.',12,0,100,0,0,29148,'FACTION_A'),
(64812,14,0,'How do we bring a swift and decisive end to the conflict? I believe the answer lies with heroes like you.',12,0,100,0,0,29150,'ABOUT_CONFLICT'),
