(69810,6,0,'We share a common enemy, Regent Lord, nothing more.',12,0,100,2,0,35883,''),
(69810,7,0,'With all respect - these abominable tools should be destroyed!',12,0,100,5,0,35884,''),
(69810,8,0,'We share a common enemy, Lady Proudmoore. Nothing more.',12,0,100,2,0,35846,''),
(69810,9,0,'My lady. Weapons of the Thunder King are an abomination. They should be destroyed.',12,0,100,2,0,35847,''),
(69837,0,0,'The Celestial Defender manifests an area of |cFFFF2222|Hspell:140068|h[healing energy]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(69917,0,0,'The mogu forge weapons of both blood and steel. Their blades feast on death.',12,0,100,0,0,35831,''),
(69917,1,0,'Slaves - everywhere slaves. You can see what we fight against.',12,0,100,0,0,35832,''),
(69917,2,0,'Step lightly! We are almost to the gate.',12,0,100,0,0,35841,''),
(69926,0,0,'How dare you interrupt our preparations! The Zandalari will not be stopped, not this time!',14,0,100,1,0,35737,''),
(69926,1,0,'Destroy them, I command you! No, stop, stop!',14,0,100,25,0,35736,''),
(69949,0,0,'The siege is underway but our heavy explosives never made it to the wall!',12,0,100,5,0,35920,''),
(69949,1,0,'Gather up the explosives and get them to the wall while I rally the reinforcements.',12,0,100,1,0,35921,''),
(69949,2,0,'The wall is wired up and ready to go - the honor is all yours!',12,0,100,1,0,35922,''),
(69949,3,0,'This way - the Zandalari are falling back!',14,0,100,5,0,35923,''),
(69949,4,0,'What... what did they DO to that troll!?',12,0,100,5,0,36381,''),
(69949,5,0,'It is nothing. I am fine.',12,0,100,5,0,35928,''),
(69964,0,0,'BEHOLD! I have truly mastered the fel energies of this world! The demonic power I now command... It is indescribable, unlimited, OMNIPOTENT!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(69964,1,0,'You think I\'ve gone too far? There is no such thing. The Black Harvest will enslave the most powerful demons, draw on their power, and destroy all who oppose us, in this world, and on Azeroth! Do YOU mean to stop me, little one?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(69964,2,0,'I\'d like to see you try.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(69964,3,0,'Hah. Your feeble attacks are entertaining. Would you like to see one of my new pets?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(69964,4,0,'The Annihilan are incredibly destructive creatures. Their sheer strength and power is absolutely unrivaled.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(69964,5,0,'Hah ha ha... You thought you could defeat me? NOTHING can kill me now, puny mortal!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(69964,6,0,'And now, your sad tale comes to an end.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(69964,7,0,'Jubeka?! What are you...?!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(69964,8,0,'...AUGHHHHHH!!!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(70041,0,0,'Up here, champion!',12,0,100,0,0,35358,''),
(70041,1,0,'I think we have figured out a way to ward our flying mounts against the lightning. But fly in loose formation, just in case.',12,0,100,0,0,35944,''),
(70041,2,0,'Our continued incursions into the graveyard and town below are already paying off. Neither the mogu nor the Zandalari should be able to mount a counter-attack.',12,0,100,0,0,35945,''),
(70041,3,0,'Do you see the central tower? Lightning strikes it continuously. We suspect the storms originate from the heart of the palace itself.',12,0,100,0,0,35946,''),
(70041,4,0,'The Thunder King\'s palace lies ahead. We must secure a foothold on the island before we can assault his fortress.',12,0,100,0,0,35978,''),
(70041,5,0,'The rendezvous is just up ahead. We\'ve gathered an elite strike force - What?',12,0,100,0,0,35947,''),
(70041,6,0,'Anar\'alah! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!',12,0,100,0,0,35948,''),
(70041,7,0,'Down! Everybody down!',12,0,100,0,0,35949,''),
(70041,8,0,'Ugh! Hold on!',12,0,100,0,0,35977,''),
(70041,9,0,'Champion, are you all right?',12,0,100,0,0,35950,''),
(70041,10,0,'They were ready for us all along. Our forces are scattered, and we are on our own.',12,0,100,0,0,35951,''),
(70041,11,0,'So much for the element of surprise.',12,0,100,0,0,35952,''),
(70041,12,0,'They are falling back! We need to press the assault before they can regroup. Follow me!',12,0,100,0,0,35953,''),
(70041,13,0,'The entrance is barricaded. Break it down!',12,0,100,0,0,35955,''),
(70041,14,0,'Good work, hero. Let\'s move on.',12,0,100,0,0,35963,''),
(70041,15,0,'Be quick on your feet - that is no ordinary Zandalari!',12,0,100,0,0,35956,''),
(70041,16,0,'I like your style, hero.',12,0,100,0,0,35966,''),
(70041,17,0,'The shield - it is down! We did it!',12,0,100,0,0,35961,''),
(70041,18,0,'Jaina was right to recommend you. You saved this mission from disaster... and saved my life.',12,0,100,0,0,35962,''),
(70074,0,0,'Forgemaster Vul\'kon equips his Staff and begins to channel the powers of lightning!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70074,1,0,'Forgemaster Vul\'kon equips his Hammer and begins to swing with great force!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70092,0,0,'Don\'t fall back. Don\'t give them an inch!',14,0,100,0,0,35484,''),
(70092,1,0,'Well done! We\'re through - pull together, everyone. Press the advantage!',14,0,100,0,0,35492,''),
(70092,2,0,'It\'s dead! You\'re an inspiration to the Kirin Tor!',12,0,100,0,0,35493,''),
(70092,3,0,'Vereesa, are you hurt?',12,0,100,0,0,35494,''),
(70092,4,0,'You need to get back to camp. I can\'t lose you.',12,0,100,0,0,35495,''),
(70092,5,0,'Gather up the wounded! We\'ve struck a mighty blow today - the next part of our campaign begins.',12,0,100,0,0,35496,''),
(70099,0,0,'The Shado-pan Defender has placed a |cFFFF2222|Hspell:132744|h[Healing Orb]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70099,1,0,'Thank you for your help, adventurer.  We will assist you as best we can in fending off the mogu.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70099,2,0,'The forge is safe, and we must take our leave.  Good luck on your quest, adventurer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70228,0,0,'The Sha Amalgamation begins casting |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139382|h[Insanity]|h|r!  Discharge one of the anvils to stop it!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70371,0,0,'Aethas, leave us for a moment.',12,0,100,0,0,35651,''),
(70371,1,0,'Hero, you have served the Horde nobly across many campaigns. I feel I can take you into confidence.',12,0,100,0,0,35652,''),
(70371,2,0,'Our Warchief\'s campaign across Kalimdor and Pandaria is pulling the Horde apart at the seams.',12,0,100,0,0,35653,''),
(70371,3,0,'We are here to fight the Thunder King. Justice demands it, and Hellscream is too preoccupied at Domination Point to pay attention here.',12,0,100,0,0,35654,''),
(70371,4,0,'But, in defeating him, we must seek out the source of his great power. We must claim it for ourselves, as leverage against our "Warchief."',12,0,100,0,0,35655,''),
(70371,5,0,'In the event of an uprising, we must be prepared.',12,0,100,0,0,35656,''),
(70371,6,0,'Heads up!',12,0,100,0,0,35657,''),
(70371,7,0,'Ha-hah! It will feel good to bloody my blade again. Against Alliance or mogu, does not matter to me.',12,0,100,0,0,35658,''),
(70371,8,0,'Enough talk. You know how precarious our position is. Between the Alliance and the Thunder King, only with the help of heroes like you can we hope to succeed here.',12,0,100,0,0,35659,''),
(70371,9,0,'Anar\'alah belore, hero. Good luck.',12,0,100,0,0,35660,''),
(70372,0,0,'Over 12,000 years ago, the Mogu empire was founded by Lei Shen, "The Thunder King."',12,0,100,0,0,35970,''),
(70372,1,0,'He united the mogu, conquered the other pandaren races, and built an empire that would last for thousands of years.',12,0,100,0,0,35971,''),
(70372,2,0,'Legend has it that the Thunder King possessed enormous power, and built himself a palatial fortress. We should be able to see it soon...',12,0,100,0,0,35972,''),
(70373,0,0,'Pandaren legends tell of Lei Shen, "The Thunder King." He was the brutal founder of the Mogu empire over 12,000 years ago.',12,0,100,0,0,35350,''),
(70373,1,0,'He united the mogu, defeated the other pandaren races, and founded a glorious nation with the slave labor of those he conquered.',12,0,100,0,0,35351,''),
(70373,2,0,'The Thunder King built a palatial fortress on the borders of his empire. We should see it soon...',12,0,100,0,0,35352,''),
(70516,0,0,'According to this runestone, the mogu were Titan constructs, soulless creatures built of stone. We suspected as much.',12,0,100,0,0,36412,''),
(70516,1,0,'You\'ve found another stone! What have we learned? The "curse of flesh" made the mogu mortal. Ah - but later, they found a way to reverse the process. A clever race.',12,0,100,0,0,36413,''),
(70516,2,0,'The mogu served a Titan keeper. His name was "Ra." In the mogu tongue, "Ra-den" means "Master Ra." Fascinating! I must know more!',12,0,100,0,0,36414,''),
(70516,3,0,'According to this, the mogu and their master were sent to Pandaria. They were pursuing a great darkness - ah, the fragment is incomplete. We must find others.',12,0,100,0,0,36415,''),
(70516,4,0,'Here, there is mention of an Old God. "Y\'Shaarj." A beast with seven heads, who breathed darkness. I suspect that thing was the source of the sha that haunts Pandaria to this day.',12,0,100,0,0,36416,''),
(70516,5,0,'This runestone speaks of a "Cradle of Life." A place where the Titans could create new creatures. Oh - of course - the Vale of Eternal Blossoms! It was a living laboratory, much like Un\'goro Crater or Sholazar Basin.',12,0,100,0,0,36417,''),
(70516,6,0,'We\'re beginning to put the pieces together, champion. The mogu were created and sent here to guard the Vale for their Titan masters. Guard it from what? Were the Old Gods still a threat?',12,0,100,0,0,36418,''),
(70516,7,0,'Here, this fragment speaks of "The Winged Legions of Y\'Shaarj." Servants of an Old God? Could this mean the mantid?',12,0,100,0,0,36419,''),
(70516,8,0,'This runestone is more recent than the others. Something about "The sleeping keeper." I think it\'s referring to Ra-Den. But why was he asleep?',12,0,100,0,0,36420,''),
(70516,9,0,'You\'ve found another piece of the puzzle! This was carved by the mogu. They were frustrated - a thousand years with no orders from their master, and their bodies had turned to flesh. The mogu began to argue among themselves.',12,0,100,0,0,36421,''),
(70516,10,0,'Hmmm. This runestone speaks of mogu savagery. They fell apart into warrior clans. But one King was more ambitious than the others - Lei Shen. The Thunder King. When the Titan Keeper fell silent, Lei Shen decided to speak for him.',12,0,100,0,0,36422,''),
(70516,11,0,'Ah! The final piece of the puzzle. The Thunder King took on the powers of Ra-Den, the very essence of a Titan. He united the mogu into an empire and tried to continue the Titans\' work. Of course he saw himself as a God!',12,0,100,0,0,36423,''),
(70678,0,0,'Luckydo floot!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70678,1,0,'Stupid grummlepack!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70740,0,0,'Ya want a present?! WELL, MY LEGS DON\'T EVEN WORK!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70740,1,0,'My bling is blung...',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70740,2,0,'ELEC... TRICITY... GREATEST... WEAKNESS...',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71108,0,0,'I am looking forward to this: The White Tiger is the embodiment of strength in Pandaria!',12,0,100,1,0,37385,''),
(71108,1,0,'Great White Tiger! Hear our plea.',12,0,100,5,0,37434,''),
(71108,2,0,'My champion and I seek the blessing of your strength.',12,0,100,1,0,37467,''),
(71108,3,0,'I take great pride in the company I keep.',12,0,100,1,0,37435,''),
(71108,4,0,'The power to crush one\'s foes. That is strength.',12,0,100,1,0,37436,''),
(71108,5,0,'Certainly, strength can benefit one\'s allies.',12,0,100,273,0,37437,''),
(71108,6,0,'...by using it to crush their enemies!',12,0,100,5,0,37438,''),
(71108,7,0,'Wait - that\'s absurd. I would annihilate my own champion!',12,0,100,274,0,37388,''),
(71108,8,0,'... interesting. But the outcome is unlikely to change.',12,0,100,6,0,37389,''),
(71108,9,0,'Very well. I am sorry, champion - But I will not be the one learning a lesson today.',12,0,100,1,0,37390,''),
(71108,10,0,'A blind dragon. Ridiculous!',12,0,100,1,0,37391,''),
(71142,0,0,'Here we are, the home of Niuzao, the Black Ox. He is the patron spirit of Pandaren fortitude, the only celestial who chooses to live beyond the wall.',12,0,100,1,0,37387,''),
(71142,1,0,'Mighty Black Ox! Hear our plea.',12,0,100,1,0,37409,''),
(71142,2,0,'My champion and I seek your blessing of fortitude.',12,0,100,1,0,37410,''),
(71142,3,0,'The strength to overcome any hardship! This is fortitude.',12,0,100,1,0,37411,''),
(71142,4,0,'You mean to say - physical strength is developed without, but fortitude comes from within?',12,0,100,1,0,37412,''),
(71142,5,0,'...Sure. I knew that.',12,0,100,1,0,37413,''),
(71152,0,0,'And then the Old One will remake this world for the Mantid!',14,0,100,0,0,38677,''),
(71152,1,0,'Avenge me, brothers!',14,0,100,0,0,38675,''),
(71153,0,0,'Come children of the Titans, you face the Paragons.',14,0,100,0,0,38609,''),
(71153,1,0,'The hunter... becomes... the hunted....',14,0,100,0,0,38607,''),
(71154,0,0,'We will slay you all as easily as we slew the Pandaren of old.',14,0,100,0,0,38637,''),
(71154,1,0,'You move too slowly, how does your kind catch any prey?',14,0,100,0,0,38634,''),
(71154,2,0,'Curse this chitinous shell, I was not fast enough!',14,0,100,0,0,38635,''),
(71155,0,0,'We have endured the Usurpers, their children, the loss of the Old One, and soon... you.',14,0,100,0,0,38670,''),
(71155,1,0,'You now face the Prime. Bow down to your superior!',14,0,100,0,0,38667,''),
(71155,2,0,'Return me to the amber...',14,0,100,0,0,38668,''),
(71156,0,0,'It matters not, the Old One will not suffer their intrusion.',14,0,100,0,0,38646,''),
(71156,1,0,'Come little Kunchongs, it\'s feeding time!',14,0,100,0,0,38790,''),
(71156,2,0,'Kovok... come to me... I need...',14,0,100,0,0,38643,''),
(71157,0,0,'We Mantid serve a power far greater than they or their gods.',14,0,100,0,0,38707,''),
(71157,1,0,'Have you come to try my new concoctions, Wakener?  I assure you these are nothing like you\'ve tasted before.',14,0,100,0,0,38704,''),
(71157,2,0,'So many wonderful varieties, which concoction shall I give you?',14,0,100,0,0,38709,''),
(71157,3,0,'I never discovered... how to put a stopper... in death...',14,0,100,0,0,38705,''),
(71158,0,0,'They made it this far? I told you the others needed some micro-sonic genetic alterations.',14,0,100,0,0,38916,''),
(71158,1,0,'Yes... new test subjects!',14,0,100,0,0,38913,''),
(71158,2,0,'Perhaps I could have used... some enhancements... of my own...',14,0,100,0,0,38914,''),
(71160,0,0,'How illogical, did they not hear your warning Kil\'ruk?',14,0,100,0,0,38621,''),
(71160,1,0,'Chaos is order unrecognized by a lesser mind!',14,0,100,0,0,38618,''),
(71160,2,0,'How about a game?',14,0,100,0,0,38623,''),
(71160,3,0,'My calculations, incorrect? Perhaps another 800 years...',14,0,100,0,0,38619,''),
(71161,0,0,'Look brothers, the Wakener is here!',14,0,100,0,0,38657,''),
(71161,1,0,'I will carry you one last time Wakener... to your doom!',14,0,100,0,0,38654,''),
(71161,2,0,'Well fought Wakener.  We will meet again...',14,0,100,0,0,38655,''),
(71166,0,0,'The Red Crane of Hope has inspired the citizens of Pandaria from the very dawn of history. I very much want to speak with him.',12,0,100,1,0,37386,''),
(71166,1,0,'Great Red Crane! Hear our plea.',12,0,100,1,0,37392,''),
(71166,2,0,'My champion and I seek your blessing of hope.',12,0,100,1,0,37393,''),
(71166,3,0,'Hope is... a belief in a better tomorrow.',12,0,100,1,0,37394,''),
(71166,4,0,'...Great Crane. You have not seen what I have seen.',12,0,100,0,0,37395,''),
(71166,5,0,'... the fires that once burned the sky will return. It is inevitable. The Burning Legion WILL find Azeroth.',12,0,100,0,0,37396,''),
(71166,6,0,'Seas of blood, cities in ruin! Who are we - one divided world - to stand against a legion?',12,0,100,0,0,37397,''),
(71166,7,0,'You speak of hope. Believe me, the thinnest sliver of belief that we might somehow survive the coming devastation is all that sustains me.',12,0,100,0,0,37398,''),
(71166,8,0,'... thank you, Great Crane.',12,0,100,1,0,37399,''),
(71177,0,0,'Step aside goblin.  This artifact is exactly what the warchief hoped to find here.  I am taking it under Kor\'kron protection.',12,0,100,5,0,37182,''),
(71177,1,0,'You are paid for all workers present, foreman.  The warchief does not compensate the dead.',12,0,100,1,0,37183,''),
(71177,2,0,'THIS.  This is what has diluted the vitality of our precious Horde!',12,0,100,0,0,37184,''),
(71177,3,0,'The warchief graciously permits the families of the dead to live in his city.  To die in the service of the Horde should be a great honor, but you see it as another opportunity to line your filthy pockets!',12,0,100,1,0,37185,''),
(71177,4,0,'Your kind DISGUSTS me.  Small.  Weak.  Honorless as thieves.  Be thankful the warchief still tolerates your presence at all.',12,0,100,5,0,37186,''),
(71177,5,0,'What was that, goblin?',12,0,100,547,0,37187,''),
(71426,0,0,'Welcome back, champion!',12,0,100,1,0,37415,''),
(71426,1,0,'Excellent work with the celestials. Can you believe how chatty they were?',12,0,100,1,0,37416,''),
(71426,2,0,'I just wanted them to hand us our reward, but they were just, "talk talk talk talk talk."',12,0,100,1,0,37417,''),
(71426,3,0,'I\'m sorry - where were we? Oh yes! I have something for you:',12,0,100,1,0,37418,''),
(71426,4,0,'The very spirits of Pandaria are supporting us in our grand crusade! Behold:',12,0,100,1,0,37419,''),
(71426,5,0,'The strength of the White Tiger.',12,0,100,25,0,37420,''),
(71426,6,0,'The wisdom of the Jade Serpent.',12,0,100,1,0,37421,''),
(71426,7,0,'The fortitude of the Black Ox.',12,0,100,1,0,37422,''),
(71426,8,0,'And from the Red Crane, a shining beacon of hope for a better world!',12,0,100,1,0,37423,''),
(71426,9,0,'Our world.',12,0,100,1,0,37424,''),
(71426,10,0,'There! It is ready.',12,0,100,1,0,37425,''),
(71658,0,0,'Intruders! I will lock you in a cell with the rest of the filth.',14,0,100,5,0,39032,''),
(71740,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Siege_Engineer_Superheated.blp:20|t An Activated Laser turret has locked on to you!',42,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71788,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Siege_Engineer_Detonate.blp:20|tA Crawler Mine has targeted you!',42,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71788,1,0,'A crawler mine detonated on $n!',16,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71828,0,0,'Greetings. I am Sikari, master of jade lightning, chi, and healing mists. For this trial, you must protect me from the incoming illusions, while I heal you and dispatch our foes.',14,0,100,0,0,38439,''),
(71828,1,0,'Illusionary Rippers approaching. They should pose little challenge; they are but mindless grunts.',14,0,100,0,0,38428,''),
(71828,2,0,'Illusionary Foragers are attacking. Do not let their cute faces fool you. They can work together to cause terrible devastation.',14,0,100,0,0,38433,''),
(71828,3,0,'Greetings, again. Our next trial will be more challenging. Prepare to defend me.',14,0,100,0,0,38438,''),
(71828,4,0,'A new enemy, Illusionary Flamecallers. They cast fireballs and spew lava. Use the lava to your advantage; it will burn the other illusions.',14,0,100,0,0,38430,''),
(71828,5,0,'Beware! Illusionary Wind-Guards can use their wings to knock you back. When they do, they will likely switch to attacking me instead.',14,0,100,0,0,38431,''),
(71828,6,0,'Once again, you must defend me. Rotun, give us a challenge this time.',14,0,100,0,0,38437,''),
(71828,7,0,'Illusionary Ambushers! Get their attention, quick. And get them away from me, so they cannot hit me with their devastating bananas!',14,0,100,0,0,38432,''),
(71828,8,0,'Prepare your defenses. That is an Illusionary Conqueror! When they become enraged, they gain great strength, and nothing can stop them.',14,0,100,0,0,38429,''),
(71869,0,0,'Good deal. Welcome to the spirit world. Kinda. Let\'s check out the chests for any goodies, and see if you can find my body somewhere!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,0,'I thought about askin\' her out but I didn\'t have the guts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,1,'What kind of spirit haunts a chicken coop? A poultry geist!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,2,'I\'m not THAT snarky, am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,3,'Want to hear somethin\' funny? Coccyx.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,4,'Sorry for ribbin\' ya so much.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,5,'Sticks and stones may break my bones...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,6,'Who just called me a numbskull?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,7,'I love you wit\' every bone in my body!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,8,'I\'m not sure I have the stomach for this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71869,1,9,'I know my jokes ain\'t so good... I lost my funny bone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71967,0,0,'You have been judged, and proven yourselves worthy. But be warned, what lies beyond will try your souls to their utmost.  When you are fully prepared, you may enter the chamber.',14,0,100,0,0,38882,''),
(71967,1,0,'The corruption is amplifying.  The fragments must be purged before it becomes too great.',14,0,100,0,0,38903,''),
(71967,2,0,'It did not matter. It comes.  Steel your hearts and prepare your souls.',14,0,100,0,0,38904,''),
(71967,3,0,'You... must... contain... it...',14,0,100,0,0,38902,''),
(72218,0,0,'Hello. For this trial, you must keep us alive while we face the incoming illusions. I am Oto, and will protect you.',14,0,100,0,0,38599,''),
